    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Walker Core is the companion plugin for WalkerWP Themes, which provides core functionality and custom post type for the themes.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>you can install Walker Core Plugins as following two ways:<br />\n1. Upload zip file from Dashboard-&gt;Plugin-&gt;Add New &#8220;upload plugin&#8221;.<br />\n2. Extract Walker Core and placed it to the &#8220;/wp-content/plugins/&#8221; directory.<br />\n    &#8211; Activate the plugin through the &#8220;Plugins&#8221; menu in WordPress.</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='is%20walker%20core%20is%20a%20free%20plugin%3F'>\nIs Walker Core is a free plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it is a free plugin.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20use%20this%20plugin%20for%20any%20theme%3F'>\nCan i use this plugin for any theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>This is the companion plugin for themes of WalkerWP so we don&#8217;t recommended to using with other theme.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.3.18 &#8211; 27 November, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Security Patch: XSS Vulnerability</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://plugins.svn.wordpress.org/walker-core/trunk/changelog.txt\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">See changes for all the versions here.</a></p>\n"
    },
